# Safe production changes (HTR sites)

Live sites: **htrgrouptx.com** / **appfixpro.com** (appliance), **dentequmentfix.com** / **dentalfixpro.com** (dental).

## Before any deploy

1. Run `node scripts/build-pages-bundle.mjs` — it must pass asset verification (no missing `/assets/*` files).
2. Commit **both** `assets/index-utf8-v4.js` **and** all PNG/JPG copied into `assets/` (never JS-only deploy).
3. Do not bump HTML `?v=` without pushing matching static files.

## Domain / brand changes

1. Add new domain in code; **keep legacy domain** in `siteDomains.ts` / `businessType` until old DNS redirects 301 to new.
2. DNS: add Cloudflare Pages custom domain **before** removing old records; never point A/CNAME to registrar parking IPs.
3. Prefer env overrides (`PUBLIC_BASE_URL`, `WEBAUTHN_RP_ID`) over hard-breaking defaults.

## Forbidden without explicit user approval

- Removing legacy hostname detection while old domain still serves traffic.
- Deploying bundle that references assets not present in `assets/`.
- Changing Vite `assetFileNames` / base URL without full asset sync test on production URL.

## After deploy

Verify on **old and new** domain: homepage, service card images, booking form, `/admin` login.
